== History==
2016
*The Bomber [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], increased the Bomber's hit speed to 1.9 seconds (from 2 seconds).
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], changed the Bomber so that he would no longer stop his attack if his target dies during the attack animation. It also decreased the Bomber's sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level cap to 13 (from 12). The update also fixed the "range bug", which decreased the Bomber's range to 4.5 tiles (from 5 tiles), but his effective range was unchanged.
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Bomber's damage by 10%.
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], increased the Bomber's damage by 9%.
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]], decreased the Bomber's hitpoints by 2% and increased his damage by 2.5%. This resolved a minor issue where [[Goblins]] could not defeat an equal Level Bomber in three hits at some Levels, e.g. Level 7.
*On 15/12/2016, the [[Version History#December 2016 Update (15/12/2016)|December 2016 Update]], increased the Bomber's damage by 4%.
2017
*On 16/3/2017, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(16/3/2017)|maintenance break]], increased the Bomber's projectile speed to 400 (from 300). This was done to fix some unexpected behavior that the Bomber showed.
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Bomber from [[Training Camp]] to Bone Pit.
*On 2/7/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Bomber's range to 5 tiles (from 4.5 tiles).
2019
*On 28/1/2019, the [[Version History#January%202019%20Update%20(28/1/2019)|January 2019 Update]], made a small change to the Bomber's card description.
*On 6/5/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/5/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Bomber's hitpoints by 28%.
*On 30/9/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20September%202019%20Update%20(30/9/2019)|End of September 2019 Update]], added an extra [[Star Points|Star Level]].
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Bomber's card info screen.
2020
*On 9/9/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/9/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Bomber's attack time interval to 1.8 seconds (from 1.9 seconds).
2021
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Bomber's cost to 2 [[Elixir]] (from 3 Elixir), decreased his hitpoints by 31%, and decreased his damage by 32%.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], decreased the Bomber's range to 4.5 tiles (from 5 tiles).
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 3/1/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/1/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Bomber's damage by 4%.
*On 5/2/2024, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/2/2024)|February 2024 Update]], added the Bomber's Evolution.
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Bomber's damage by 2%.
2025
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)|Balance Update]] decreased Bomber's Hitpoints by 7%.

